      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_002_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那是，今天这期话题特别带劲，我跟你说我一上午都在憋着想跟你聊。",
      "start": 13.658,
      "duration": 6.835,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_003_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "行，那咱们就放开聊。",
      "start": 20.946,
      "duration": 1.959,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_004_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我先抛第一个事儿啊，最近硅谷那边有个特别有意思的现象，你注意啊——大家现在不聊模型了，改聊算力。谁手里攥着GPU，谁就是大爷。",
